You have a [15%, 25%, 32%, 39%, 45% (TL1-5)] chance on dealing blight damage to cause the target to rot away, silencing, disarming, blinding or pinning them for [2, 3, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns. This effect has a cooldown.

At talent level 4, this affects targets in a radius 1 ball.

Your worms also have a [7%, 12%, 16%, 19%, 22% (TL1-5)] chance to blind, silence, disarm or pin with their melee attacks, lasting 2 turns.

The chance to apply this effect will increase with your Spellpower.
